      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3203287f0a7207a55202b20845db577af8687766d3989cd5e30af80b49a675d8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我去年受凍的腳完全好起來，可是今年沒有凍，壁爐着得呼呼發響，時時起着木柈的小炸音；玻璃窗簡直就沒被冰霜蔽住；柈子不像去年擺在窗前，而是裝滿了柈子房的。",
      "output_sha256": "b616d0c5e3f687caec4c0c7622ff9aa0748f44369af0f460c54d3cdb68980afb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "b616d0c5e3f687caec4c0c7622ff9aa0748f44369af0f460c54d3cdb68980afb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我們決定一定要回國。",
      "output_sha256": "f131fe38bb55a0835355fef431249bb40eee61e4a6be354144fd42e5f2929ca3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.625,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "07f884d56c7c6c782fdefb46edb81d56cdb0648c037ebc0f6cff75d906bb0697"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f131fe38bb55a0835355fef431249bb40eee61e4a6be354144fd42e5f2929ca3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "每當走進書店，卻發現一本雜誌也沒有，至於其他書籍，還是三年前擺在玻璃窗裡、已經褪色的舊書。",
      "output_sha256": "c1e26a7bd81be3fb4c20c4deda46f6fb7e2b7cbb55e897e4104f3b2f3627324e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.643605,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "06d50d5a7e2e14121db484fa7c67d6919e767e8dc4be99f03e187a86e2b56cd6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c1e26a7bd81be3fb4c20c4deda46f6fb7e2b7cbb55e897e4104f3b2f3627324e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "非去不可，非走不可。",
      "output_sha256": "2c46931b7515a558add1e9daeda056e0b1ad96bb2802fea72a363508b753ef38",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "2c46931b7515a558add1e9daeda056e0b1ad96bb2802fea72a363508b753ef38",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "遇見朋友時，我們便詢問：“海上幾月波浪較小？",
      "output_sha256": "aef1dc12cc6c165ed0ed6197ca4d5e21e653fe008d5ef06be06210bb3577f682",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.590939,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6,
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5d9d5d3bc2fa34392a9c16e705e9f5bfa1abce2754ee0f33c38f19377645b254",
        "4f1b581ffd176fb75da78eea01e0117a956639416a0e3a903e70e0d714ea011a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "aef1dc12cc6c165ed0ed6197ca4d5e21e653fe008d5ef06be06210bb3577f682",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "小海船是怎樣暈法？",
      "output_sha256": "79ca89d760e4b78450b5291e273af1995a410f754a57050d7a2f176b1a1684ac",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "79ca89d760e4b78450b5291e273af1995a410f754a57050d7a2f176b1a1684ac",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "……”因爲我們都沒航過海，海船那樣大，在圖畫上看見也是害怕，所以一經過“萬國車票公司”的窗前，必須要停住許多時候，要看窗子裏立着的大圖畫，我們計算着這海船有多麼高啊！",
      "output_sha256": "33a9380cb3d0d4e4ae3e710d2235d6ced13ce4fbcf9677cb34b03114ec4ad250",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "33a9380cb3d0d4e4ae3e710d2235d6ced13ce4fbcf9677cb34b03114ec4ad250",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "都說海上無風三尺浪，我在玻璃上就用手去量，看海船有海浪的幾倍高？",
      "output_sha256": "ed012d85c9f8c946d9260db99c886c2c01836a9f586ed150d0807c64a1cb04ca",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "ed012d85c9f8c946d9260db99c886c2c01836a9f586ed150d0807c64a1cb04ca",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "結果那太差遠了！",
      "output_sha256": "75fd158c4e86ca93bceb9123ca33c866714bda030a1c852311d9d65dded363fb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "75fd158c4e86ca93bceb9123ca33c866714bda030a1c852311d9d65dded363fb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "海船的高度等於海浪的二十倍。",
      "output_sha256": "110c9e4dec1be0d46defe9c8c21638c3fab76ccdbaaaef15f264c01bdec31c61",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "110c9e4dec1be0d46defe9c8c21638c3fab76ccdbaaaef15f264c01bdec31c61",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我說海船高六丈。",
      "output_sha256": "315678ecf8dfad94981b28acc88eb02af6dd8861b4d30aa80395dfa1e7eaac89",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.760714,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f6ac692163c87844029e2a4c2e83713b8c0a5f7a2973d14e7fd66ba4f59574a1"
